---
import { FEATURED_PROJECTS } from '../data/projects';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../data/siteConfig';
---

<section id="proyectos" class="section relative overflow-hidden py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-white/[0.06]">
  
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan/[0.04] rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-brand/[0.04] rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="container-safe">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div data-reveal class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="section-line w-16 mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full"></div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight">
        Casos en producción
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Sistemas y sitios web reales diseñados y desarrollados a medida. Funcionando continuamente, atendiendo clientes y procesando consultas todos los días.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Case Studies List -->
    <div class="space-y-16 sm:space-y-24">
      
      <!-- Project 1: Tu iPhone Zona Norte -->
      <article data-reveal class="card card-hover p-6 sm:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
          
          <!-- Info Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
            
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-300 border border-teal-500/30 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
                E-Commerce Boutique & Cotizador
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/[0.06]">
                Zona Norte & CABA
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              Tu iPhone Zona Norte
            </h3>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Sitio web oficial y cotizador interactivo desarrollado para una de las boutiques de iPhone más reconocidas de Zona Norte (+18K seguidores). Los clientes eligen modelo (iPhone 11 a 17), condición, salud de batería y cotizan su plan canje en tiempo real, agilizando la atención sin intermediarios ni comisiones.
            </p>

            <!-- Results Card -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-teal-500/20 shadow-inner space-y-1.5">
              <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                Impacto en el negocio:
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Automatizó más del 70% de las consultas frecuentes sobre stock y precios, convirtiendo seguidores de Instagram en clientes con cotizaciones claras.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Metric Row -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 pt-1">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono">+18K</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Seguidores en IG</div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-teal-400 font-mono">0%</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Comisiones</div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-cyan-400 font-mono">&lt;0.4s</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Carga móvil</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action Link -->
            <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-4">
              <a 
                href="https://tuiphonezonanorte.com.ar"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-primary btn-md group"
              >
                <span>Visitar tuiphonezonanorte.com.ar</span>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Visual Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center">
            <div class="browser-frame w-full max-w-lg shadow-2xl group">
              <!-- Browser Header -->
              <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-slate-950 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">
                  <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 text-teal-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span>https://tuiphonezonanorte.com.ar</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-6"></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Visual Image / Mockup Preview -->
              <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-slate-950 p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <img 
                  src="/assets/projects/tuiphone-logo.jpg" 
                  alt="Tu iPhone Zona Norte" 
                  class="max-h-24 sm:max-h-32 w-auto object-contain filter drop-shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 mb-4"
                />
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/10 text-slate-300">
                    Astro v5
                  </span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/10 text-slate-300">
                    Tailwind CSS
                  </span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/10 text-slate-300">
                    SEO Local
                  </span>
                </div>
                
                <a 
                  href="https://tuiphonezonanorte.com.ar"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm"
                >
                  <span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                    Ver Sitio en Vivo ↗
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Project 2: Ariel Stefanazzi -->
      <article data-reveal class="card card-hover p-6 sm:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
          
          <!-- Visual Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-2 lg:order-1 flex justify-center">
            <div class="browser-frame w-full max-w-lg shadow-2xl group">
              <!-- Browser Header -->
              <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-slate-950 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80"></span>
                  <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">
                  <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 text-teal-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                    <path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span>https://arielstefanazzi.com.ar</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-6"></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Visual Image / Mockup Preview -->
              <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-slate-950 p-2 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
                <img 
                  src="/assets/projects/arielstefanazzi.jpg" 
                  alt="Ariel Stefanazzi Gestoría y Licitaciones" 
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
                />
                
                <a 
                  href="https://arielstefanazzi.com.ar"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm"
                >
                  <span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">
                    Ver Plataforma en Vivo ↗
                  </span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Info Column -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-6 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-6">
            
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-500/15 text-violet-300 border border-violet-500/30 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
                Plataforma Institucional & Licitaciones
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/[0.06]">
                Corporativo
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
              Ariel Stefanazzi
            </h3>

            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Plataforma institucional de alta velocidad y diseño formal desarrollada para gestor integral especializado en Licitaciones Públicas de Salud (Casa de Gobierno / Min. de Salud), logística hospitalaria (Hospital Favaloro y Molas) y permisos viales técnicos ante DPV.
            </p>

            <!-- Results Card -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-violet-500/20 shadow-inner space-y-1.5">
              <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-violet-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                Impacto en el negocio:
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Posicionó al estudio como un referente de seriedad absoluta ante laboratorios y empresas nacionales con gestión transparente de trámites.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Metric Row -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 pt-1">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-violet-400 font-mono">&lt;0.3s</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Velocidad de carga</div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white font-mono">3 Áreas</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Licitaciones / Logística</div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.06] text-center">
                <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-teal-400 font-mono">99.9%</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-0.5">Disponibilidad</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Action Link -->
            <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-4">
              <a 
                href="https://arielstefanazzi.com.ar"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-secondary btn-md group"
              >
                <span>Visitar arielstefanazzi.com.ar</span>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Direct Consultation Strip -->
    <div data-reveal class="mt-16 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl card flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 border-teal-500/20" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20,184,166,0.06), rgba(139,92,246,0.04));">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center sm:text-left">
        <h4 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white">¿Tenés un proyecto o idea en mente?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">Coordinamos por correo electrónico los objetivos de tu negocio y lo ponemos en marcha.</p>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="#contacto"
        class="btn btn-primary btn-md flex-shrink-0 group"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
        </svg>
        <span>Enviar consulta por correo</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
